Test corpus (corpus/files, installed at /opt/loveos/test-files and copied to EASYROMS by flash-macos.sh)
  Made for r3i6nos on 2026-11-09 and 2026-11-11 by the maintainer's own apps (ansiapps): Neumetik's generators, writers and its tracker tests' hand-built
  songs, Composer, Painter and Animator; the rest (corpus/src, scripts/corpus_extra.py, scripts/corpus_formats.py) written for r3i6nos: pictures drawn
